I've found that I can run the 386 version under Windows 3.1 if I
give it a PIF with all available XMS memory.  I've a 6 meg machine
with a 10 meg swap file.

Without Windows, I've found I was able to get it running if I 
removed EMM386 from my CONFIG.SYS.

